<title>UK: UK notes in circulation rise 6.2 pct in week.</title>
<headline>UK notes in circulation rise 6.2 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>British bank notes in circulation rose 6.2 percent in the week to Jan 29 over the equivalent year-ago week, data released by the Bank of England showed. Last week the annual rise was 6.9 percent.</p>
<p>NOTES IN CIRCULATION (in rounded bln stg) -</p>
<p>				Latest week  pvs week	yr-ago week</p>
<p> Notes in circulation     20.55	 20.59	   19.36</p>
<p> Bankers' deposits	   2.17	  1.99	    1.76</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
